    {
      "body": "Closing in favor of #64312, which supports the same CSF-compressed NVFP4 block scales generically at the ModelOpt quantization layer (config-driven `weight_scale_encoding`) and additionally covers `csf_32x2_v1`. I verified this PR's decoder against `nvidia/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-FP4-Local` (147,456 CSF stream tensors across the routed experts) and it produces byte-identical scales to what #64312's `_decode_csf` rebuilds, so no unique value remains here. Thanks for picking this up 👍",
